00:14:06,790 --> 00:14:10,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Goku finally intends to</i>
<i>display his true ability...</i></font>

166
00:14:10,520 --> 00:14:12,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I can't wait!</i></font>

167
00:14:20,400 --> 00:14:22,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kame...</i></font>

168
00:14:22,800 --> 00:14:25,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>hame</i>...</font>

169
00:14:28,060 --> 00:14:30,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>ha</i>!</font>

170
00:14:51,070 --> 00:14:55,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">My word!</font>

171
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:03,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>He's an experienced fighter!</i></font>

172
00:15:05,250 --> 00:15:10,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">K-Kuririn is down!</font>

173
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:11,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">One!</font>

174
00:15:11,980 --> 00:15:13,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Two!</font>

175
00:15:13,620 --> 00:15:18,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Three! Four! Five!</font>

176
00:15:18,090 --> 00:15:20,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Six!</font>

177
00:15:25,590 --> 00:15:31,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Incredible! Kuririn is back on his feet!</font>

178
00:15:32,500 --> 00:15:34,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'd have it no other way!</font>

179
00:15:34,550 --> 00:15:38,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That was a fun little attack you did there!</font>

180
00:15:46,060 --> 00:15:50,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Time to counterattack! Prepare yourself!</font>

181
00:16:16,090 --> 00:16:18,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>He's way too strong!</i></font>

182
00:16:18,230 --> 00:16:21,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>There's no way to win in a head-on fight!</i></font>

183
00:16:26,230 --> 00:16:28,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Unbelievable!</font>

184
00:16:28,270 --> 00:16:33,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Kuririn's strength is in the
realm of superhuman, but still...</font>

185
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:40,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Alright! There's only one</i>
<i>way to win this thing!</i></font>

186
00:16:41,610 --> 00:16:45,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku! This time,
you better be ready for real!</font>

187
00:16:49,990 --> 00:16:56,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Kamehame</i>...</font>

188
00:16:56,500 --> 00:16:57,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't, Kuririn!</font>

189
00:16:57,900 --> 00:17:00,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The <i>Kamehameha</i> won't work on me!</font>

190
00:17:00,730 --> 00:17:04,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You'll just waste your energy!</font>

191
00:17:07,350 --> 00:17:09,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>ha</i>!</font>

192
00:17:28,810 --> 00:17:31,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">See? I told you!</font>

193
00:17:51,480 --> 00:17:55,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I did it!</font>

194
00:17:57,220 --> 00:17:58,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sorry, Goku!</font>

195
00:17:58,870 --> 00:18:01,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I had to grab your weak point... your tail!</font>

196
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:02,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Weak point?!</i></font>

197
00:18:04,180 --> 00:18:06,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You lose!</font>

198
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:13,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I didn't want to do this,
but a fight's a fight!</font>

199
00:18:14,890 --> 00:18:18,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Excellent thinking, Kuririn!</i></font>

200
00:18:18,230 --> 00:18:19,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How does it feel, Goku?</font>

201
00:18:19,430 --> 00:18:24,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now that I have your tail, victory is mine!</font>

202
00:18:27,180 --> 00:18:29,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku-<i>san</i>!</font>

203
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:48,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, my! Son is down!</font>

204
00:18:48,170 --> 00:18:51,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What on earth could have happened?!</font>

205
00:19:03,660 --> 00:19:07,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">One! Two!</font>

206
00:19:07,170 --> 00:19:09,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Three!</font>

207
00:19:09,130 --> 00:19:10,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Four!</font>

208
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:12,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">His tail, huh?</font>

209
00:19:12,370 --> 00:19:16,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Looks like that brat
had quite the weak spot.</font>

210
00:19:16,770 --> 00:19:21,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Which means I'll be fighting that
Kuririn boy in the final match...</font>

211
00:19:21,750 --> 00:19:24,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Piece of cake.</font>

212
00:19:24,170 --> 00:19:29,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Five! Six!</font>

213
00:19:29,940 --> 00:19:32,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Seven!</font>

214
00:19:32,710 --> 00:19:36,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eight! Nine!</font>

215
00:19:38,010 --> 00:19:39,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I won!</font>

216
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:42,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Te...</font>

217
00:19:49,130 --> 00:19:50,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

218
00:19:56,130 --> 00:19:58,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Too bad!</font>

219
00:20:02,590 --> 00:20:04,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's impossible!</font>

220
00:20:04,600 --> 00:20:10,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I thought you lose all your strength
when your tail is grabbed?!</font>

221
00:20:11,470 --> 00:20:15,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I tried really hard these past
three years to toughen my tail up!</font>

222
00:20:15,990 --> 00:20:19,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The Turtle Hermit told me
to toughen it up, remember?</font>

223
00:20:19,730 --> 00:20:23,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So now I'm just fine if
someone squeezes my tail!</font>

224
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:24,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No way!</font>

225
00:20:24,900 --> 00:20:28,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Toughening it up was really hard!</font>

226
00:20:28,840 --> 00:20:31,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Incredible!</i></font>

227
00:20:31,270 --> 00:20:36,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I do remember telling him to toughen it up...</i></font>

228
00:20:46,160 --> 00:20:50,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...but it's not an easily overcome weakness.</font>

229
00:20:54,030 --> 00:20:56,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>He must have undergone</i>
<i>rather intense training!</i></font>

230
00:20:56,800 --> 00:21:00,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>That's what's so amazing about Goku.</i></font>

231
00:21:00,600 --> 00:21:02,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Perhaps he was born with it;</i></font>

232
00:21:02,440 --> 00:21:05,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>it's not just wild strength and power!</i></font>

233
00:21:18,990 --> 00:21:22,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>More than anything else,</i>
<i>he's docile and serious!</i></font>

234
00:21:37,840 --> 00:21:40,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Goku no longer has any weaknesses!</i></font>

235
00:21:48,320 --> 00:21:51,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's dirty!</font>

236
00:21:51,220 --> 00:21:54,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He wants to win, no matter what!</font>

237
00:21:54,060 --> 00:21:55,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That was dirty!</font>

238
00:21:55,590 --> 00:21:59,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There's no such thing as dirty
fighting in a match like this!</font>

239
00:21:59,260 --> 00:22:01,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He <i>did</i> have a weakness!</font>

240
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:06,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's <i>too</i> docile and serious...</font>

241
00:22:11,180 --> 00:22:12,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright, then!</font>

242
00:22:12,920 --> 00:22:15,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What?</font>

243
00:22:22,100 --> 00:22:24,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son-<i>kun</i> disappeared!</font>

244
00:22:24,300 --> 00:22:26,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where is he?!</font>

245
00:22:31,810 --> 00:22:33,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Above me!</font>

246
00:22:35,520 --> 00:22:38,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Or not...</font>

247
00:22:38,090 --> 00:22:39,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He vanished!</font>

248
00:22:39,950 --> 00:22:43,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What on earth?!</font>

249
00:22:43,290 --> 00:22:49,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son suddenly disappeared
before our very eyes!</font>

250
00:22:51,440 --> 00:22:54,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No way!</font>

251
00:22:54,050 --> 00:22:55,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Impossible!</font>

252
00:23:04,540 --> 00:23:08,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's that sound?!</font>

253
00:23:08,550 --> 00:23:11,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He really disappeared!</font>

254
00:23:11,020 --> 00:23:13,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Though I can still sense him...</font>

255
00:23:13,550 --> 00:23:15,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, he hasn't disappeared.</font>

256
00:23:15,920 --> 00:23:18,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's just not visible.</font>

257
00:23:37,400 --> 00:23:40,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>If I can barely see him,</i></font>

258
00:23:40,530 --> 00:23:42,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>then there's no way anyone else can!</i></font>

259
00:23:44,300 --> 00:23:48,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>He's moving back and forth</i>
<i>with unbelievably intense speed!</i></font>

260
00:23:56,360 --> 00:23:59,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>He's getting closer and closer!</i></font>

261
00:24:20,820 --> 00:24:22,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He appeared!</font>

262
00:24:31,840 --> 00:24:34,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ring out...</font>

263
00:24:34,740 --> 00:24:39,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son wins...</font>

264
00:24:39,680 --> 00:24:42,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I did it!</font>

265
00:24:45,430 --> 00:24:49,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What a disappointing ending!</font>

266
00:24:49,330 --> 00:24:53,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son suddenly appeared
and surprised Kuririn,</font>

267
00:24:53,470 --> 00:24:56,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">causing him to fall outside the ring!</font>

268
00:24:58,910 --> 00:25:00,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What the?!</font>

269
00:25:00,540 --> 00:25:05,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That was an exciting match
up until the end, huh?</font>

270
00:25:05,450 --> 00:25:07,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What a boring fight.</font>

271
00:25:10,220 --> 00:25:13,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>What do you mean,</i>
<i>"disappointing ending"?</i></font>

272
00:25:17,920 --> 00:25:21,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>The instant that Son kid appeared,</i></font>

273
00:25:21,330 --> 00:25:24,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>he gave eight hand chops!</i></font>

274
00:25:24,030 --> 00:25:28,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Plus he gave a kick strong enough</i>
<i>to knock him out of the ring!</i></font>

275
00:25:32,010 --> 00:25:34,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Such a formidable boy!</i></font>

276
00:25:34,340 --> 00:25:39,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>He may indeed have been strong</i>
<i>enough to defeat Tao Pai Pai!</i></font>

277
00:25:40,650 --> 00:25:45,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Every time I see Goku,</i>
<i>he's grown even better...</i></font>

278
00:25:45,190 --> 00:25:49,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I get the feeling that I'm no longer needed...</i></font>

279
00:25:53,330 --> 00:25:56,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's the end of the fighting for today.</font>

280
00:25:56,130 --> 00:25:59,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The final match will take place tomorrow.</font>

281
00:26:01,520 --> 00:26:06,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sorry, I went and won!</font>

282
00:26:06,090 --> 00:26:10,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm nowhere near as strong as you are...</font>

283
00:26:10,420 --> 00:26:16,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But how did you disappear
and suddenly send me flying?</font>

284
00:26:16,430 --> 00:26:19,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll show you how to do it later!</font>

285
00:26:25,540 --> 00:26:27,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Good work today!</font>

286
00:26:27,540 --> 00:26:29,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You both did great!</font>

287
00:26:29,780 --> 00:26:32,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, I embarrassed myself...</font>

288
00:26:32,550 --> 00:26:36,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, you were really strong!</font>

289
00:26:36,280 --> 00:26:39,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah! It was the best fight
ever between two friends!</font>

290
00:26:39,890 --> 00:26:40,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Really?</font>

291
00:26:40,890 --> 00:26:44,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tomorrow's the final match, Goku.</font>

292
00:26:44,960 --> 00:26:47,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah! I'm gonna try hard!</font>

293
00:26:47,760 --> 00:26:50,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">First you'll need food to energize yourself!</font>

294
00:26:50,060 --> 00:26:54,360
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Great!
- I'm starving!</font>

295
00:26:58,590 --> 00:27:02,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I know your strength.</font>

296
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:06,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>The title of strongest fighter under heaven</i></font>

297
00:27:06,930 --> 00:27:11,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>will be determined at the</i>
<i>22nd Tenkaichi Budokai.</i></font>

298
00:27:11,840 --> 00:27:15,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>The final match is set for tomorrow.</i></font>

299
00:27:15,540 --> 00:27:21,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Will the last laugh belong</i>
<i>to Goku, or Tenshinhan?</i></font>

300
00:27:45,750 --> 00:27:48,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oide fantaji</i></font>

301
00:27:45,750 --> 00:27:48,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Come along, fantasy</i></font>

302
00:27:48,650 --> 00:27:51,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Suki sa misuteri</i></font>

303
00:27:48,650 --> 00:27:51,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I enjoy a mystery</i></font>

304
00:27:51,260 --> 00:27:57,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kimi no wakasa kakusanai de</i></font>

305
00:27:51,260 --> 00:27:57,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Don't you go hiding your youth!</i></font>

306
00:27:57,830 --> 00:28:00,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Fushigi shitakute</i></font>

307
00:27:57,830 --> 00:28:00,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to perform the mysterious</i></font>

308
00:28:00,830 --> 00:28:03,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Boken shitakute</i></font>

309
00:28:00,830 --> 00:28:03,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to pursue the adventure</i></font>

310
00:28:03,330 --> 00:28:09,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Dare mo min'na uzu-uzu shite 'ru</i></font>

311
00:28:03,330 --> 00:28:09,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Everyone is itching to go!</i></font>

312
00:28:09,340 --> 00:28:15,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Otona no furi shite akiramecha</i></font>

313
00:28:09,340 --> 00:28:15,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you act like an adult and give up</i></font>

314
00:28:15,350 --> 00:28:21,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kiseki no nazo nado tokenai yo</i></font>

315
00:28:15,350 --> 00:28:21,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>You'll never unravel the mystery of the miracle!</i></font>

316
00:28:21,520 --> 00:28:32,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Motto wairudo ni motto takumashiku ikite goran</i></font>

317
00:28:21,520 --> 00:28:32,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Go on and try to live</i>
<i>even more wild and strong!</i></font>

318
00:28:32,630 --> 00:28:40,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

319
00:28:32,630 --> 00:28:40,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

320
00:28:40,200 --> 00:28:44,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Honto no yuki misete kuretara</i></font>

321
00:28:40,200 --> 00:28:44,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you will show me your true courage</i></font>

322
00:28:44,710 --> 00:28:52,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

323
00:28:44,710 --> 00:28:52,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

324
00:28:52,080 --> 00:29:00,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Tokimeku mune ni</i>
<i>kira-kira hikatta yume o ageru yo</i></font>

325
00:28:52,080 --> 00:29:00,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give your pounding heart</i>
<i>a glittery, shining dream!</i></font>

